    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">A product oriented contributor, a software engineering manager and a long-time promoter of automation, from the early days of scripting to today's AI-driven workflows. My roles included department manager, delivery manager, lead mobile engineer, tech consultant, administrator, co-founder and mentor.</p><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">My latest major role involved building a department from the ground up, growing it to 34 specialists while delivering a suite of banking &amp; trading mobile apps reaching 1.2 million users. The department and its products were built on strong foundations, designed to support growth and be resilient to industry shifts.</p><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">What I am interested in:</p><ul><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Digital transformation initiatives</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Building / Leading highly specialised teams</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Complex ecosystems, be it in technology, stakeholder management, operations or market dynamics</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Designing automation while preserving human agency and system integrity / Harness Engineering</p></li></ul><p></p>"
  },
